# Domain in code

- Menu numbers, surcharges, base-variant selection, ingredient merge, and validation live in `src/domain` with tests.
- Do not encode production pricing/numbering rules only in Cursor rules or LLM prompts.
- ValueOrigin must distinguish SOURCE / DERIVED / SYSTEM_DEFAULT / HUMAN_CORRECTION.
- Status aggregation: BLOCKED > MANUAL_REVIEW_REQUIRED > WARNING > READY — one function only.
- DUPLICATE_SOURCE_MENU_NUMBER → MANUAL_REVIEW; DUPLICATE_ASSIGNED_MENU_NUMBER → BLOCKED.
